<title>UK: London silver fixes firmer at 434.50 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes firmer at 434.50 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 434.50 cents vs 431.25 cents previously. Firmer with rest of complex. Technical indicators improving but resistance likely at 440 cents.</p>
<p>GOLD - Steady at $325.25/$325.75 up $1.45. Holding early firmer level. Option expiry Tuesday.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also firmer at $424.50/$427.50, up $2.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $3.50 at $202.50/$205.50.</p>
</text>
